// src/v4/extdeps/formats/openapi.dag
// Scope: OpenAPI 3.1.0 document slice; Lane C (TASKS.md T-4.6).
// Owns: OpenAPI 3.1 grammar schema, document/wire-contract fact-bundles and HTTP method/status bridges.
// Consumes: compiler/tokenize.dag, compiler/parse.dag, std/node.dag, std/diagnostic.dag, std/collection.dag, std/nat.dag, std/network.dag, extdeps/coordination.dag, extdeps/formats/json_schema.dag, extdeps/formats/json.dag, extdeps/formats/yaml.dag
